WEBVTT

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.910
<i>Save me... Just save me, please...</i>

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.490
<i>Tell me, why has my Eden become like this?</i>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.740
<i>If this world is no longer an Eden,</i>

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.500
<i>then I don't need it anymore.</i>

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:05.600
Asai, did you do something in the dream world?

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.390
What happened?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:10.980
Katagiri's brain waves are
becoming extremely weak.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.690
The only activity is in the parts of the brain stem
absolutely necessary to keep her alive.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:17.030
Any idea what caused it?

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.650
I don't know.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.700
But...

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.240
An ability can't be used unless you truly wish it to.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.040
If she thinks that there's no point
to the dream world anymore,

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.000
she might find herself unable
to continue using her ability.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.710
For her, not using her ability
is like committing suicide.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:39.380
I didn't want you to see me in this state.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.550
How are you feeling?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.890
Forget about me.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.230
I can't simply forget.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.980
You can.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.730
It's just like those past six years.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.940
We didn't have any reason to meet.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.990
You told me yourself.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:04.240
Laughing with other people by your
side is what you can call happiness.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:08.450
Even if you're by my side, you can't laugh.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.210
I'm fine alone.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:20.630
I want him to be happy.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:25.560
But I wasn't able to laugh by his side.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.890
Why is that?

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.930
Because he's growing very old.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.520
That is somehow painful.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:36.230
When I thought about it, it made me very sad.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.280
I'm sure that people who give milk to cats

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.780
dislike solitude by nature.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.500
Should I reset?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.420
Haruki,

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.000
did something happen when you met Tyltyl?

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.680
I finally understand what I myself wish for.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.720
I want to grow.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:09.720
I want to be of greater value
than anyone or anything else to Kei.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.100
No, nothing really.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:18.820
I'm pretty confident I know your voice, face, gestures better than anyone else.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:19.820
That's true.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.200
I know when you're hiding something.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.200
Yes, I'm aware.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.120
I see.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.080
Haruki...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.120
It's time to reset.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.830
Reset.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.840
It's September 23rd, exactly 11:50.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:46.590
Seems like we've reset.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.720
Did something happen?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.560
In the dream world, there was a god, and a monster,

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.190
and also Ukawa,
which was actually quite a problem.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.480
Ukawa?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.020
Do you mean Ukawa Sasane?

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.230
Yeah.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.530
It's very complicated.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.450
Is it something I have to hear too?

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:09.280
Yes. Half of what I'm going to say is regarding
you and the old man from the stray cat mansion.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.740
But before that...

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:13.580
Souma!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.120
Are you watching this future?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.830
If you are, I need your help.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:23.210
Make me able to meet Tyltyl
once I enter the dream world.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.800
What is that supposed to mean?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.970
It's something like a magic spell.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.930
Once you two fall asleep,
just start doing what we agreed on.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.480
Welcome to the dream world!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.940
So you're Kei?

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.480
Yes.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.820
Misora was just telling me about you.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.030
She said you'd be here soon.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.030
You came here to meet Tyltyl, right?

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.700
If I ask him, he'll grant any wish.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.710
No, I came here to meet you.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.840
Why do you lie like that?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.630
It's not a lie.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.220
I'm here to look for the blue bird with you.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.260
I already found the blue bird.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.140
As long as I'm in this world, I can be happy.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.140
The blue bird you caught is fake.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.440
I know how to find the real one.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.770
Stay with me for a bit.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:24.110
What are you plotting?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.190
Nothing.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.700
If I had evil intentions, Tyltyl would get rid of me.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.830
Tyltyl will definitely protect you.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:35.700
Isn't that true?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.540
It is.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.830
I guess I can accompany you for a bit.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.770
Shall I make the wind a bit stronger?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:01.020
No, it's fine like this. Thanks.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.200
It's been quite a while, Sumire.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.530
I'm happy to see you again.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.620
Hello, Tyltyl.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.790
You're still playing god, I see.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.290
<i>I don't see a reset in the future...</i>

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.540
<i>So they already did.</i>

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.840
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.670
Not really, don't really have any reason to.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.340
You have to meet with Asai Kei.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.430
And why is that?

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.510
If you don't do anything, Mytyl...

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.060
Katagiri will stop using her ability.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.400
You never told me of such a future.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.900
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.980
But it was the best way to handle the situation.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.320
Will me meeting Asai Kei solve the problem?

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:56.740
I guess. If you do what he says,
everything will be fine.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.000
I don't have any reason to trust you.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.120
But you do trust me.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.630
I see it in your future that you do.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:07.630
Your words are almost like the Script.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.170
No,

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:13.380
the future I see isn't absolute.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:16.760
This is boring.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.180
Where will we go once we're done eating?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.140
We'll think about that after we've finished.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.350
Do you know the old man
from the stray cat mansion?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.150
Oh, I've heard about him, I think...

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.940
Have you never met him?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.150
No, what about him?

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:33.360
Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.410
Hey, let's go to an amusement park after this!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.870
There's no amusement park in Sakurada.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.370
It's fine.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.120
If we ask Tyltyl, he'll make one.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.670
I actually have something to take care of after this.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.340
Weren't you here to meet me?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.380
Indeed.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.340
Then why don't you put aside
everything else for now?

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.090
It's a bit complicated.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:00.720
I can't trust someone who won't
stay with me at night, when it's dark!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.310
Aren't you running after her?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.650
This is enough for now.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.650
What are you trying to achieve?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.410
I just want to fulfill our promise.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.370
Promise?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.410
The one we made before the reset.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:26.540
I'll solve Mytyl's problem and you'll help me.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.210
Mytyl is afraid of solitude.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:29.960
Yeah.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:34.090
Why don't you introduce the old man
from the stray cat mansion to her?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:39.970
Before she became Mytyl,
Katagiri Honoka was already afraid of him.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:45.480
He was the only one to point out that
by being given one thing, you can lose another.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.400
What's wrong about a dream world?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.730
Why is this dream world wrong?

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.820
There's no reason why this world is wrong.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.490
That's why I want you to cooperate.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.700
We won't let anyone disapprove of this world.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.370
I'm coming in.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.380
It's been a while.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.630
You are...

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.010
I don't remember how many years it has been.

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:25.640
Five years, eleven months, and nine days.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:33.230
I've been thinking about a lot of things.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.820
Thinking?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:38.650
I've always felt as if you were my real grandfather.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.530
I feel like I forced you to care for me.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:45.160
I don't remember you ever imposing on me.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:48.290
You might have simply not noticed that.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.120
And?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.500
That's why I've reflected on my attitude.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.010
Just like people don't think
about making the god happy,

00:10:56.010 --> 00:11:00.630
it doesn't even occur to small children
that the grandfather protecting them

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.390
also deserves some happiness.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.260
Of course.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.310
Every person has their role.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:11.270
The role of children isn't to make adults happy.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.940
I want to be your friend,
which is why my attitude was wrong.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.400
Friend?

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.110
Yes, friend.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:24.370
I've been thinking about what the role of a friend is.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.790
Have you found an answer?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.700
Yes.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:32.540
Friends are there to keep you from being lonely.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.790
I see.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:42.340
Please, listen to what I want to ask of you.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.520
Save me...

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.940
Tyltyl, save me...

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.690
Please, save me...

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.690
I can't.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.150
You should know that, Katagiri Honoka.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.700
I can't save you.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.490
That's not my name!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.870
Save me...

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.010
Save me.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.510
Save me!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.770
Please... save me!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.740
Sorry I'm late, Mytyl.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.450
How did you find me?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.030
I heard your voice.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:52.080
If you wish it, I'll protect you.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.880
Why are you even here?

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.590
I told you.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.470
I know how to find the blue bird.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.890
I don't understand!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.270
You don't have to understand for me to save you.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.100
I managed to stop your tears.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.810
You can't make an Eden with just one hand.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:21.570
But now, between our joined hands, Eden exists.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.320
This is how you create an Eden!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.570
This is how you can catch your own blue bird!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.080
So Tyltyl put them in a fake dangerous situation,

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.290
and Kei plays the hero who won't abandon
Mytyl when she needs protection.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.710
His lies are always filled with kindness.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.670
Isn't that right,

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.050
Haruki Misora?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.890
It's been a while, Souma Sumire.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.970
It certainly has.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.100
What are you doing here?

00:13:56.440 --> 00:14:00.520
Kei hasn't given me any instructions,
so I have nothing to do.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.110
That's why I decided to meet you.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.070
How did you know where to find me?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.870
This is the best place to watch Kei.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.830
Souma Sumire, what are you trying to achieve?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.210
That's for me to know.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.750
I never even told Kei,
so I'm not going to tell anyone else.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.500
Will your actions make Kei sad?

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.130
They might.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.930
But it's better than doing nothing.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.760
Even if he's sad or in pain,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.770
I won't change my goal.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.810
If that's the case, Souma Sumire,

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.770
I don't want you anywhere near Kei.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.780
Two years ago,

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:48.280
I was thinking exactly the same thing.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.160
I didn't want you getting closer to Kei.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.790
You're the one who introduced us to each other.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.950
True.

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:59.500
No matter how sad and painful it was for me,
and how much I didn't want to,

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:03.340
I still chose to bring you two together.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.470
Please tell me one last thing.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.590
What is it?

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.350
Are you...

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.810
Asai Kei's enemy?

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.770
No.

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:21.150
He's the sole reason I'm still here.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.060
I see.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.700
Save me, Tyltyl!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.620
Tyltyl won't be coming.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.950
Why?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.740
Because there's no need to.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.210
Katagiri Honoka, you should
be able to erase the monster.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.170
That's not my name!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.460
Remember.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.920
It's fine. You're not alone anymore,

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.590
Katagiri Honoka!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.510
Accept the monster inside of you!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.230
<i>He's gone.</i>

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.650
<i>I finally talked with someone other than myself,</i>

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.610
<i>and felt the warmth of another human.</i>

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.450
<i>And now, because I've been running away...</i>

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.950
<i>Because I've been pretending to be Mytyl...</i>

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.990
<i>The blue bird was here just a moment ago!</i>

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.080
<i>While I was wavering, it flew away!</i>

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.340
I don't know what happened,

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.180
but the first step after you fall is to stand up.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.690
Who are you?

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:49.320
An old acquaintance of mine came to visit.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:54.820
She told me a friend of her friend's
was crying, and asked for help.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.820
Before I knew it, I was standing here.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.080
I've met you once before.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:06.330
You're the god of this world, if I remember correctly.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.880
Yes.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.340
I'm the one who created this world.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.090
I see.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:16.550
I need to tell you one thing, then.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:20.100
I finally understood the difference
between a god and a demon.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.100
And that is?

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:27.230
A god laughs for other people,
while a demon laughs for itself.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.980
Is there a difference?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.490
If you're laughing for someone,
it's the same as being their friend.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.450
I'm sure my friend laughed for me.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.040
By the way, my god.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.330
Could I pray to you to answer one wish of mine?

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:48.920
There was a bit of a fuss,
and my house got destroyed.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.960
Could you do something about it?

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:56.430
Tyltyl, it's fine.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.560
<i>My emotions...</i>

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.940
<i>What I truly wish for...</i>

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.570
Return to me.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.850
I guess... all's well that ends well?

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.610
Yesterday I felt there was something
wrong about this world,

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.020
but today I don't.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.790
Are you this world's Souma?

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.660
No, I came here from reality.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.580
I'm asleep on the roof of the hospital.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.040
The roof?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.760
The range of Katagiri's ability is a sphere,

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:19.880
so you can enter the dream world
if you sleep directly above her.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:25.140
Was me meeting Nonoh
also all according to your plan?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.260
Of course.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.390
The two of you connecting
was just another line in the Script.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:34.860
I've been thinking about taking
you outside of Sakurada.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.900
I want to know what would happen if we did that.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:42.360
I believe I already told you that's for me to know?

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:45.580
I don't want to leave Sakurada.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.740
I want to stay in this town forever.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.790
Kei,

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.920
you were really cruel this time.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:57.710
Using me as a guinea pig just
because we're not in the real world?

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.050
Normally such a thought
wouldn't even cross your mind.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.590
I just wanted to know the answer.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.890
Is it okay to take you outside of Sakurada?

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.520
You wanted to know it for Haruki Misora's sake.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.720
Souma,

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.400
why are you so fixated on staying in this town?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.480
That should be obvious, Kei.
It's because you're here.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:21.240
And I love you.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.330
Thank you.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.620
But I love Haruki more than you.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.580
Is that feeling genuine, though?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.920
You might just be misinterpreting
your own feelings.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:40.920
Sympathy, camaraderie, curiosity,
compassion, respect, envy...

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.010
All of those feelings mix together,
creating an illusion of love.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.760
Souma,

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:51.100
feeling all of those emotions towards just one girl

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.520
basically means that I love her.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:57.810
I'm the type who enjoys bullying people I like,

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.570
so I'll tell you one more thing.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.450
With the last reset, you erased something.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:08.830
And what might that have been?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:14.160
Haruki finally found the courage
to break out of her fake Eden.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:18.290
She wanted her relationship with you
to be not only about your abilities,

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.840
and, just like you wanted two years ago,

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:24.260
she felt an emotion close to a normal girl's affection.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.590
She wished to be with you.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:30.260
And you erased all of that with a reset.

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:34.730
I see...

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.350
That's as bad as it gets.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.360
Weren't you prepared for that?

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.570
What resets affect the most
is definitely Haruki herself.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:47.740
And yet you're still going to keep using it.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.740
Because I decided it's the right thing to do.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.500
Next Episode

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:57.960
It's a school festival, you know!

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.540
Have you prepared a cool line?

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:00.880
I wonder if Haruki will be able to smile.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.460
I don't have any right to stand on this stage.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.760
My plan will definitely succeed.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:06.840
I'm already too tired of this.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:10.010
Souma, I'll definitely put an end to that summer.

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:20.400
On such a cold dark sky of grey

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:26.610
Rises the sun, which breathes life into it

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:32.870
A scenery so plain and so mundane

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:42.460
And yet it seems to break my heart, it's so dear to me

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:46.920
As the time never stops passing by

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:49.300
You get lost while searching for

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:53.180
Pure like the rays of a morning star

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:56.100
What we all yearn for the most

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:59.520
In what colors bliss is dyed

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:02.150
Struggling against all your past mistakes

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.190
At last from the answer you found kindness fills your heart

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:08.360
More beautiful than anything you know

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.990
And you find it behind a dark veil of sadness

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.490
If I closed my eyes and stopped my thoughts

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.240
If it were so simple to just

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:19.250
Lock your own heart

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:22.380
How lovely life would be

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:27.630
But I believe you have the key

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:33.970
To let my soul be free
